---
import DirectoryLayout from '../layouts/DirectoryLayout.astro';
---
<DirectoryLayout title="Support" description="Find the right channel for an existing engagement or an open-source tool.">
  <h2>Existing customers</h2>
  <p>Use the support contact and escalation path in your agreement or operating handoff. Coverage, response times, and ongoing work depend on that agreement.</p>
  <p>If you cannot find the right contact, email support with the project name and a short description. Do not send passwords, API keys, private customer data, or sensitive logs.</p>
  <a class="route-action" href="mailto:support@intentsolutions.io">Email support</a>
  <h2>Open-source tools and plugins</h2>
  <p>Check the project's README and support instructions. Use its public issue tracker for reproducible bugs that are safe to share. Follow SECURITY.md for sensitive reports when the repository provides it.</p>
  <a class="route-action" href="/projects/">Find a project</a>
  <h2>New work</h2>
  <p>A new build or a change outside an existing agreement starts with a request and a scope review.</p>
  <a class="route-action" href="/contact/?door=outcome">Request an outcome</a>
</DirectoryLayout>
